  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet hn-vs-b455f8b9ce05</b></p><a name=\"hn-vs-b455f8b9ce05\"> </a><a name=\"hchn-vs-b455f8b9ce05\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html\"><code>http://ltc-ig.fhir.tw/CodeSystem/hn-answer</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?1.1.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-c625ac31484e1\">c625ac31484e1</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">能單獨處理家事或偶而需要協助較繁重的家事(如：搬動家具、清理廚房且完成歸位)。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-c123cb0bf3a2f\">c123cb0bf3a2f</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">能做較簡單的家事，如洗碗、鋪床、疊被。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-cb87a267c89a0\">cb87a267c89a0</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">能做較簡單的家事，但不能達到可被接受的整潔程度。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-c5c47dbabcd67\">c5c47dbabcd67</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">所有的家事都需要別人協助。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-c7ed535cab260\">c7ed535cab260</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">完全不會做家事。</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
